cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the EdgeRock technical report using the preferred citation below."
title: "EdgeRock: Strong Reasoning at Constant Memory"
abstract: >-
  EdgeRock is Rock Matrix's family of multimodal reasoning models with
  constant-size persistent history for long-context inference. EdgeRock-4B
  combines recurrent state, sliding-window attention, and Rock Memory Anchors
  to retain direct access to selected distant information within an O(1)
  history budget. This repository provides model implementation, inference
  and evaluation code, benchmark comparisons, and the technical report.
keywords:
  - multimodal reasoning
  - large language models
  - constant-memory inference
  - long-context inference
  - KV cache
  - Rock Memory Anchors
  - sliding-window attention
  - recurrent models
  - efficient inference
